flowchart TD
    S[Simulator or External API] --> I[Ingestion connector]
    I --> V[Zod validation + deduplication]
    V --> B[(MongoDB business_events)]
    B --> M[Metric snapshots]
    M --> A{Anomaly?}
    A -->|Yes| INV[Investigation]
    INV --> EV[Evidence retrieval]
    EV --> L[Mubit gateway - recurring diagnosis]
    L --> DI[Diagnosis schema validation]
    DI --> P[Mubit-routed solution planner]
    P --> PLAN[(ProposedPlan v1)]
    PLAN --> H[Partner approval UI]
    H -->|Approved plan version and action IDs| ORCH[Mission orchestrator]
    ORCH --> API[Restricted action APIs]
    API --> S
    API --> OUT[(ActionExecution / ActionOutcome)]
    DI --> COR[(ModelCorrection in MongoDB)]
    COR -.->|Only if supported| TRAIN[Mubit feedback + adapter training]
    L -.-> TRAIN
    TRAIN --> BENCH[Independent unseen-case evaluation]

